      "message": "The previous code didn\u0027t have to worry about the case where the IpServer did not not know about the request yet.\n\nBut with your new code the request could be null. Can the following happen?\n- Someone (e.g., Settings) calls startTethering(TETHERING_USB)\n- EntitlementManager starts provisioning\n- Before the IpServer is actually started and moves into STATE_TETHERED, USB is unplugged and maybeStopUsbProvisioning is called.\n\nIf that can happen, then I think the code won\u0027t stop provisioning even though it should.",
